msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., %1, %2, %3):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Consilios de uso\n"
"\n"
"Selectionar:\n"
"Evidentia texto (o un parola) in le libro, postea preme [Assistente IA] in le menu apparite.\n"
"\n"
"Pression longe:\n"
"- Sur un button de Prompt: Adder al menu de evidentiation.\n"
"- Sur un button del menu de evidentiation pro remover lo.\n"
"- Sur le button Clauder pro retornar al libro in 1 passo.\n"
"\n"
"Pression multo longe (plus de 3 secundas):\n"
"Sur un singule parola in le libro pro monstrar le menu de evidentiation (in vice del dictionario).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-glissamento (p.ex., %1, %2, %3):\n"
"Sur le dialogo de resultato pro clauder (proque le button Clauder es troppo lontan a attinger).\n"

